# Linux-C.O.S -- GRUB tools in the installed system, so Calamares can install
# the bootloader for whichever firmware the target uses (BIOS or UEFI). These
# are the co-installable *-bin + helpers, NOT the grub-pc / grub-efi-amd64
# metapackages (which conflict with each other): grub-install picks the
# target at install time.
#   - BIOS:  grub-install --target=i386-pc      (grub-pc-bin)
#   - UEFI:  grub-install --target=x86_64-efi   (grub-efi-amd64-bin + efibootmgr)
grub-common
grub2-common
grub-pc-bin
grub-efi-amd64-bin
efibootmgr
dosfstools
mtools
